# This folder contains public assets

## 📸 PLACE YOUR PROFILE PHOTO HERE

Your profile photo should be:
- Named: profile.jpg
- Location: This folder (public/)
- Size: 500x500px or larger (square format)
- Format: JPG, PNG, or WebP

Example:
public/
├── index.html
├── profile.jpg  ← YOUR PHOTO HERE
└── .gitkeep (this file)
